      "manifest": {
        "plugin_id": "community.mdblist-sync",
        "version": "1.0.8-beta.7",
        "checksum": "502521befa59d4de0b894db7f68f0ef3ba0b58fdd3ac085ab07b99f121ecff55",
        "silo_api_version": "v1",
        "presentation": {
          "display_name": "MDBList Sync",
          "summary": "Sync private, unlisted & public MDBList lists, Watchlist, and discover lists into Silo collections — designed primarily for MDBList Supporters.",
          "description_markdown": "**MDBList Sync** synchronizes your MDBList account into dedicated Silo collections without ever modifying unrelated collections.\n\n### Designed Primarily for MDBList Supporters\nThis plugin is built primarily for **MDBList Supporters** (Basic €1 / Standard €2 / Plus €3 / VIP €5 per month — 10,000 to 250,000 API calls/day, private lists, Watchlist, Dynamic, AI, Static, Feed, Liked, and External lists).\n\n- **Free MDBList Tier:** Free MDBList accounts (1,000 API calls/day, no Feed or AI lists) are supported for light usage, and the plugin automatically throttles background cover enrichment to help protect your daily quota. Learn more at [MDBList Supporter & API Limits](https://docs.mdblist.com/docs/supporter).\n\n### Key Features\n- **Complete List & Watchlist Sync:** Syncs your pinned Watchlist plus Private, Unlisted, and Public lists (Dynamic, AI, Static, Feed, Liked, External) with 5-poster mini-coverflows and two-way editable collection descriptions.\n- **Discover & Remote Control:** Search public lists and creators with phonetic/fuzzy matching, browse Top & Curated lists, and Like/Unlike directly from Silo.\n- **Per-Library Mapping & Ordering:** Map lists across Movie/TV libraries, optionally mirror MDBList rank order (up to Silo's 200-item ordering limit), and hide collections with 0 local matches.\n- **Flexible Automation & 37 Languages:** Scheduled + event-driven auto-sync, localized across all 37 Silo languages, with 7-day diagnostic logs and anonymized GitHub issue reporting.\n\n*Independent community plugin — the developers of this plugin are not in any way affiliated with MDBList.com. Always keep a backup of your Silo data — use at your own risk.*",
          "setup_markdown": "1. Enter your **MDBList API Key** (from `mdblist.com/preferences/#api`) and **Silo Admin API Key** (from **Admin → Sign-In & Security → API Keys**) below.\n2. Open **MDBList Sync** in the admin sidebar to fetch your lists and enable the ones you want to sync.\n3. Sync runs automatically every **24 hours** by default — you can choose a more frequent schedule directly inside the plugin under **Tasks**.",
          "homepage_url": "https://github.com/spaceabovethetrees/silo-plugin-mdblist-sync",
          "source_url": "https://github.com/spaceabovethetrees/silo-plugin-mdblist-sync",
          "support_url": "https://github.com/spaceabovethetrees/silo-plugin-mdblist-sync/issues",
          "changelog_url": "https://github.com/spaceabovethetrees/silo-plugin-mdblist-sync/releases",
          "publisher_name": "spaceabovethetrees",
          "publisher_url": "https://github.com/spaceabovethetrees",
          "license_spdx": "MIT"
